"
A PROGRAM THAT ADDS TWO NUMBERS AND REPEATS (NEURON ESOTERIC PROGRAMMING LANGUAGE)
"
!<!             "Clear current cell, switch to the cell on the left and clear that aswell."
Number_1,>      "Enter a number and switch to the cell on the right."
Number_2,       "Enter a number again."
Answer_         "Print 'Answer' with a space at the end."
[-<+>]<.        "Calculate the the sum of the 2 given numbers. (store it on the left cell)"
>\\;            "Go to the cell on the right, go to a newline twice, and repeat the program forever."

"By the way, strings are comments."
"you can use the --tape argument to determine the size of the given tape (array)"